WEBVTT

00:14.269 --> 00:17.159
An enemy squadron heading north in the
vicinity of Ogasawara has been captured.

00:18.509 --> 00:20.796
Order the immediate evacuation
of the metro area.

00:22.509 --> 00:25.433
Remaining troops from Osaka and
outlying areas have regrouped

00:25.509 --> 00:27.477
and are heading toward Kanto.

00:28.309 --> 00:29.071
Where is Chise?

00:29.189 --> 00:30.793
Speed up her preparation
for attack.

00:33.429 --> 00:37.036
Attention. The entire metro area has been
ordered evacuated immediately.

00:37.269 --> 00:41.194
Expressway exits in all 23 wards
will soon be closed to traffic.

00:41.789 --> 00:44.952
Please proceed quickly
to the nearest exit.

00:45.789 --> 00:48.269
They keep repeating the same
instructions over and over.

00:49.469 --> 00:50.470
Geez, I'm hungry.

00:50.589 --> 00:51.192
Shut up!

00:51.909 --> 00:53.354
Sorry, Lieutenant Tetsu.

00:53.669 --> 00:56.036
Please stop calling me Lieutenant.

00:56.709 --> 00:58.313
Rank isn't important right now.

00:59.029 --> 01:02.556
But Lieutenant, shouldn't you have
transferred to headquarters by now?

01:03.029 --> 01:04.315
You've been decorated
so many times.

01:04.509 --> 01:07.080
You have proved yourself here.
You can go home.

01:09.229 --> 01:11.709
That's funny. I asked someone else
that same question once.

01:12.229 --> 01:13.071
Who was it?

01:15.269 --> 01:17.590
The only superior officer
I ever trusted.

01:18.749 --> 01:19.591
<i>You're an elite soldier,</i>

01:19.669 --> 01:21.751
<i>who graduated a! the top of
your class at the Academy.</i>

01:22.229 --> 01:24.835
<i>You don'! have to be here
fighting in this dangerous place.</i>

01:25.869 --> 01:30.113
<i>Bu! then I wouldn't have me!
such a fine soldier as you...</i>

01:31.709 --> 01:34.110
I never have come across
a braver superior officer...

01:34.229 --> 01:35.879
or one that cared so much
about her soldiers...

01:37.709 --> 01:41.156
She was always the first to rush
to their aid, risking her own life.

01:50.069 --> 01:53.278
Lieutenant, what happened
to that officer?

01:53.909 --> 01:55.035
She died fighting.

01:57.469 --> 02:01.315
In battle.
Shortly after I left the squad.

02:07.309 --> 02:08.913
They were all annihilated.

02:11.149 --> 02:13.390
What do you mean
I'm being transferred to Sapporo?

02:14.189 --> 02:16.396
You wife is ill.
It's for the best.

02:18.109 --> 02:21.079
I'm a soldier.
She will understand that.

02:21.589 --> 02:22.954
I mean, she'll be fine.

02:25.709 --> 02:28.918
Squadron Leader,
you are my only superior officer.

02:29.669 --> 02:31.797
I will not obey any order
unless it comes from you.

02:31.869 --> 02:34.236
<i>This is an order from me.</i>

02:35.309 --> 02:36.231
And I promise you...

02:36.629 --> 02:38.074
I will have you
reassigned to me.

02:40.109 --> 02:40.837
I understand.

02:43.989 --> 02:44.478
Huh?

02:45.189 --> 02:46.520
This is something I cherish.

02:47.229 --> 02:48.879
Please hang on to it for me.

02:49.389 --> 02:51.835
You can give it back to me
when I return to serve under you again.

02:55.349 --> 02:55.918
<i>Tokyo is...</i>

02:57.229 --> 02:57.752
What?!!

02:59.829 --> 03:01.911
The enemy has dispatched
another large fleet of planes.

03:02.349 --> 03:05.512
Kanagawa, Tokyo, and areas within
the Yamanote Line are under attack.

03:06.869 --> 03:10.237
Mixed brigades heading toward Tokyo
are being attacked from the rear.

03:11.909 --> 03:14.674
Chise is airborne over Tokyo.
She will engage shortly.

03:24.029 --> 03:25.110
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

03:26.149 --> 03:27.833
<i>I'm so evil...</i>

03:29.829 --> 03:31.558
<i>I'm the god of death</i>

03:33.109 --> 03:36.716
<i>I'm...a monster...</i>

03:56.789 --> 03:57.676
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

03:58.269 --> 04:01.398
<i>Please...be quiet.</i>

04:02.269 --> 04:05.113
<i>I don't want to kill anymore.</i>

04:06.469 --> 04:09.632
<i>Please! Someone help me!</i>

04:11.469 --> 04:13.233
Please stop me!

04:14.309 --> 04:15.754
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

04:16.349 --> 04:19.478
<i>I'm no! a demon!</i>

04:21.469 --> 04:23.278
The enemy is retreating.

04:24.349 --> 04:26.431
Chise is suffering terribly.

04:26.949 --> 04:28.633
She cannot articulate.

04:29.029 --> 04:31.316
She's desperately afraid
she cannot stop herself.

04:33.589 --> 04:36.513
I'm afraid she has
been overdeveloped.

04:37.629 --> 04:39.040
Overdeveloped?

04:39.549 --> 04:43.031
The weapon cells are beginning
to overtake Chise's entire being.

04:44.509 --> 04:50.118
She's becoming unable to control
the huge reservoir of power inside her.

04:50.709 --> 04:55.636
Chise will attack anyone who
attacks her, even our side.

04:57.389 --> 05:01.235
That is a risk we have to take.
We have no other choice.

05:04.429 --> 05:08.354
The enemy forces have retreated
and are regrouping in Hachioji.

05:09.389 --> 05:13.394
Chise has joined up with
our remaining forces in Ogikubo.

05:14.229 --> 05:15.469
Can Chise hold up much longer?

05:16.229 --> 05:18.596
She's managing with help
of the drugs.

05:18.989 --> 05:22.755
But her weaponry sustained
considerable damage in the battle.

05:23.509 --> 05:24.271
<i>And...</i>

05:24.389 --> 05:25.151
And what?

05:27.509 --> 05:30.240
She's under intense
psychological stress.

05:31.029 --> 05:33.236
And I'm not sure
what she might do.

05:33.789 --> 05:36.360
She needs immediate attention.

05:37.149 --> 05:37.798
Lt. Colonel?

05:39.189 --> 05:39.678
Yessir?

05:40.269 --> 05:41.430
Go take care of Chise.

05:42.789 --> 05:43.756
I understand.

05:49.949 --> 05:52.190
"Protect this nation even at
the cost of your life."

05:53.829 --> 05:57.072
My father, who was also
a soldier, said those words.

05:57.189 --> 06:01.638
From the time I was a little girl,
I have been proud of his words.

06:02.229 --> 06:06.314
And determined to protect
my country with my life.

06:06.989 --> 06:10.710
Above all else, I wanted my father to
know I took his words to heart.

06:12.109 --> 06:16.910
That's why I dedicated my life to study
and to intense physical training.

06:17.749 --> 06:22.789
There was no such thing as playing
or laughing or time with boys.

06:24.069 --> 06:26.436
And behind my back,
they called me "Cyborg."

06:28.949 --> 06:30.189
<i>What irony ...</i>

06:32.269 --> 06:34.840
That I, of all people, didn't
progress as a weapon...

06:35.389 --> 06:39.474
and such an average little girl
has or has been forced to.

06:40.149 --> 06:43.358
No, the weapon cell did
not consume me.

06:45.149 --> 06:49.552
This war is God's punishment
for our sacrilege.

06:51.709 --> 06:53.950
So, we will deserve it
when this war...

06:54.589 --> 06:55.715
Lt. Colonel Mizuki. <i>..</i>

07:05.189 --> 07:05.678
<i>The enemy?</i>

07:06.069 --> 07:06.479
Huh?

07:06.869 --> 07:07.756
<i>The enemy is coming!</i>

07:08.549 --> 07:09.994
<i>Even though I am here!</i>

07:10.629 --> 07:11.630
Where is "here"?

07:12.149 --> 07:12.911
Where is she now?

07:14.389 --> 07:15.390
<i>Somewhere over Sane.</i>

07:15.669 --> 07:19.037
<i>Oh no. They are aiming at me.</i>

07:19.509 --> 07:21.079
<i>They are locked on to me!</i>

07:21.189 --> 07:21.712
Chisel

07:22.389 --> 07:22.912
No!

07:26.629 --> 07:27.312
It hurts!

07:40.349 --> 07:42.511
<i>It hurts... Stop!</i>

07:43.549 --> 07:44.550
<i>Don't come]!</i>

07:48.509 --> 07:49.032
Chisel

07:49.509 --> 07:50.635
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

07:59.989 --> 08:00.399
No!!

08:01.829 --> 08:03.354
<i>I</i> must get them
before they get me.

08:08.029 --> 08:08.598
Chisel

08:19.349 --> 08:20.874
<i>I must protect...</i>

08:21.549 --> 08:22.630
Chise, you don't have to.

08:22.749 --> 08:24.274
The battle is over!

08:24.389 --> 08:26.118
You don't have to fight anymore!

08:29.669 --> 08:31.956
<i>But I am the definition of fighting.</i>

08:33.549 --> 08:34.436
<i>If that is true,</i>

08:34.549 --> 08:40.192
<i>I need to protect
my father, my mother, my little brother...</i>

08:41.189 --> 08:43.078
<i>And the people of my town,
all of them.</i>

08:43.189 --> 08:44.350
Chise, please wake up!!

08:45.109 --> 08:49.990
<i>As many people as
possible on this earth.</i>

08:51.389 --> 08:54.598
<i>I wan! to protect them
with my power.</i>

09:00.629 --> 09:01.471
You must survive.

09:01.869 --> 09:03.314
Chise, snap out of it!

09:03.869 --> 09:05.473
<i>Then maybe Shuji...</i>

09:06.029 --> 09:07.554
Chisel No!

09:07.629 --> 09:09.631
<i>Might compliment me more.</i>

09:24.709 --> 09:26.234
Lt. Colonel?

09:53.469 --> 09:55.756
<i>Please kill me.</i>

09:57.029 --> 09:59.919
<i>I can't stand what
I have become.</i>

10:02.789 --> 10:04.518
<i>H wan! lo live.</i>

10:04.989 --> 10:10.917
<i>Because finally...finally...
I was able to declare my love!</i>

10:13.069 --> 10:19.156
<i>There are so many things
I want to do with my love.</i>

10:32.949 --> 10:33.791
I'm so glad!

10:34.309 --> 10:35.754
You're awake.

10:37.469 --> 10:40.040
I knew there were vital signs...

10:40.789 --> 10:43.269
It's all my fault that you were...

10:43.469 --> 10:46.678
It's all right. I'm not a softie.

10:47.709 --> 10:49.154
You've already recovered?

10:51.269 --> 10:51.758
I see...

11:07.149 --> 11:08.071
What's wrong?

11:08.549 --> 11:12.315
When I take the medicine with you...

11:12.389 --> 11:13.959
it tastes pretty good.

11:14.469 --> 11:15.072
Really?

11:17.669 --> 11:19.159
Ummm I...

11:19.709 --> 11:25.000
I'm sorry I haven't obeyed
any of your orders.

11:25.949 --> 11:28.236
And yet you still came
to save me.

11:28.669 --> 11:30.876
I am your superior officer.
It's my job.

11:31.709 --> 11:32.551
<i>I'm sow--</i>

11:37.989 --> 11:39.957
May I ask you one thing?

11:40.349 --> 11:40.952
Sure. What is it?

11:43.549 --> 11:46.917
Is there someone you love?

11:47.189 --> 11:47.633
Huh?

11:49.869 --> 11:51.633
Someone I love, huh?

11:52.349 --> 11:54.716
<i>Oh, I'm sorry... I...</i>

11:56.029 --> 11:56.791
There is someone...

11:59.189 --> 12:02.079
Unfortunately, it's unrequited.

12:03.429 --> 12:04.510
Don't be disappointed.

12:06.509 --> 12:08.432
Watching you brought
back memories.

12:08.949 --> 12:11.429
That I loved someone once.

12:12.589 --> 12:15.832
That warm blood still runs
through my veins.

12:16.469 --> 12:17.470
Lt. Colonel...

12:19.509 --> 12:21.910
I want to tell you something.

12:23.429 --> 12:29.198
Whether you fight or don't fight may
not change the outcome of this war.

12:30.749 --> 12:36.791
So, if you are sick of fighting,
It's okay to run away.

12:37.269 --> 12:37.872
It Colonel...

12:38.229 --> 12:40.470
At the end,
be with the one you love.

12:40.909 --> 12:42.638
Don't have any regrets.

12:43.109 --> 12:43.951
Don't worry.

12:44.629 --> 12:47.235
No one has any right
to criticize you.

12:47.949 --> 12:49.155
Lt. Colonel Mizuki. <i>..</i>

12:49.989 --> 12:53.880
There is no one anywhere on
this earth that can defeat you, you know.

12:55.189 --> 12:58.557
I have this sudden urge to see Shuji.

12:59.709 --> 13:00.596
<i>Then go...</i>

13:01.389 --> 13:03.869
I'll report to the Director.

13:04.429 --> 13:05.032
<i>But...</i>

13:06.069 --> 13:07.878
Who do you think
is protecting him?

13:07.989 --> 13:09.514
I will not allow him to complain.

13:09.949 --> 13:13.920
I used to think you
were a strict person.

13:14.789 --> 13:15.631
I am.

13:18.749 --> 13:21.912
Lt. Colonel, will you go
walking with me again, sometime?

13:22.549 --> 13:24.074
Sure, I promise.

13:30.829 --> 13:35.198
You must tell this person
that you love him.

13:35.749 --> 13:39.196
I found the courage to do it.
So must you.

13:40.869 --> 13:41.392
You're right.

13:42.349 --> 13:43.111
<i>I'm sow--</i>

13:56.909 --> 13:59.515
Residual troops are being attacked
at the rendezvous point.

14:00.389 --> 14:03.950
Where is Chise?
Why isn't she there?

14:05.189 --> 14:07.112
Kawahara has gone
to persuade her.

14:07.709 --> 14:09.473
I don't care what it takes.
Bring her back!

14:09.789 --> 14:11.393
I think you should give it up.

14:11.509 --> 14:11.793
What?

14:12.269 --> 14:13.953
If you try to force her,

14:14.309 --> 14:16.915
Chise will not hesitate
to turn on us.

14:18.109 --> 14:18.837
Isn't that so?

14:19.109 --> 14:20.315
Ummm. Yes, it's true.

14:20.909 --> 14:24.391
It's possible for us to make her
so angry she would destroy us.

14:24.549 --> 14:25.072
Huh?

14:26.749 --> 14:28.638
Each time we send her
on a mission,

14:28.749 --> 14:31.275
she kills countless people
and destroys cities.

14:31.389 --> 14:33.710
That causes her much pain.

14:34.229 --> 14:35.116
And yet...in the past,

14:35.189 --> 14:38.352
I have ordered her to continue,
saying justice was on our side.

14:38.709 --> 14:40.120
And that is exactly so.

14:42.109 --> 14:42.792
Director!

14:43.109 --> 14:46.113
Have you ever killed anybody
with your hands?

14:46.469 --> 14:49.359
Do you know the terrible guilt
you are left with?

14:49.949 --> 14:51.713
Lt. Colonel, that's enough!

14:51.829 --> 14:55.038
How much responsibility can you
place on her frail shoulders,

14:55.109 --> 14:56.474
before you're satisfied?

14:56.669 --> 15:00.515
Will this nation truly be saved
if Chise fights for you?

15:02.629 --> 15:06.998
Then you, Lt. Colonel,
you go and fight in her place.

15:07.789 --> 15:08.312
Director!

15:12.629 --> 15:14.199
Lt. Colonel... why do you...?

15:15.029 --> 15:19.193
Hundreds of soldiers have fought
even though they knew how futile it was.

15:19.269 --> 15:20.395
And died.

15:21.349 --> 15:23.955
How can I not fight? For them.

15:24.509 --> 15:25.999
But your condition...

15:26.309 --> 15:30.439
Sgt. Major <i>Ito...</i>
take care of Chise.

15:30.989 --> 15:31.751
Lt. Colonel...

15:50.109 --> 15:52.271
Lieutenant, the order to retreat...

15:53.389 --> 15:54.879
Damn, it's about time...

15:55.429 --> 15:58.751
Guys, find a car, load up some food
and supplies and bring it around.

15:59.989 --> 16:01.434
Did you expect to walk
all the way there?

16:01.549 --> 16:02.038
Now go!

16:02.229 --> 16:02.878
Yessir!

16:04.949 --> 16:07.475
Dammit. I am not going to die here.

16:08.749 --> 16:10.513
Ryuhei! Nakamura!

16:26.589 --> 16:28.637
You're just unconscious.

16:29.629 --> 16:32.838
Geez, will you never change?

16:34.549 --> 16:37.712
<i>I wish we had me!
a long time ago, Lt. Colonel.</i>

16:37.829 --> 16:39.069
<i>I'm sure we would have...</i>

17:15.069 --> 17:18.790
Yes, if we had met a long time ago.
I would have, too.

17:19.789 --> 17:21.712
Goodbye, Tetsu.

17:29.989 --> 17:32.276
Making riceballs made me late.

17:33.429 --> 17:35.352
Wait for me, Shuji!

17:40.469 --> 17:43.393
<i>Chisel Chisel Chisel</i>

17:44.229 --> 17:44.718
<i>Chisel</i>

17:45.309 --> 17:46.231
Lt. Colonel Mizuki!

17:48.269 --> 17:49.714
That's ridiculous...!

17:50.629 --> 17:51.437
<i>Do No! Come!</i>

17:52.589 --> 17:54.034
<i>Isn't he waiting?</i>

17:55.149 --> 17:57.755
<i>I'm beyond saving.</i>

17:58.709 --> 18:01.599
<i>So when I die.
I want to die as a soldier.</i>

18:01.789 --> 18:02.199
Lt. Colonel...

18:04.069 --> 18:08.119
<i>Even if just for</i> a <i>few days,
I'll stop the enemy attack.</i>

18:11.509 --> 18:13.830
<i>Chise, you're different. Special.</i>

18:14.389 --> 18:17.313
<i>You don'! have lo die as a soldier.</i>

18:24.229 --> 18:25.071
Lt. Colonel...

18:26.189 --> 18:27.793
<i>I wanted to see you
one more time...</i>

18:28.189 --> 18:29.873
<i>And make it clear to you...</i>

18:33.549 --> 18:36.029
<i>You are NOT a weapon.</i>

18:36.909 --> 18:38.752
<i>You are in love...</i>

18:38.989 --> 18:41.913
<i>And that means you are human.</i>

18:42.829 --> 18:45.878
<i>Chise, live for my love, too.</i>

18:46.149 --> 18:47.435
<i>As a human.</i>

18:48.029 --> 18:48.837
<i>Be in love.</i>

18:49.269 --> 18:51.715
<i>And be with the man you love.</i>

18:52.509 --> 18:53.431
<i>Lt. Colonel...</i>

18:54.429 --> 18:56.272
<i>Goodbye, Chise.</i>

19:02.789 --> 19:04.314
Lt. Colonel Mizuki! !!

19:17.109 --> 19:18.998
The Lt. Colonel's readings
have disappeared.

19:22.629 --> 19:26.998
She's become the war hero
she dreamed of being.

19:27.429 --> 19:28.078
Y-Yes.

19:28.509 --> 19:30.477
Do we have enough of the drug
for a while?

19:31.149 --> 19:31.832
Yes.

19:32.989 --> 19:35.117
Manufacturing it has
become difficult.

19:35.869 --> 19:36.711
So this is a relief.

19:38.589 --> 19:39.750
Have we found Chise?

19:40.269 --> 19:41.919
Kawahara has almost reached her.

19:50.029 --> 19:51.474
Lt. Colonel. . .7

20:01.589 --> 20:02.078
Huh?

20:33.429 --> 20:38.276
<i>Lt. Colonel, Shuji and I are together
again in school, just being classmates.</i>

20:38.389 --> 20:39.276
Good work out there.

20:39.429 --> 20:44.390
<i>Shuji saw me as a weapon,
and still said he loves me.</i>

20:44.509 --> 20:45.874
<i>Thai hurts loo much.</i>

20:46.509 --> 20:48.238
<i>I can't do a thing for him.</i>

20:49.789 --> 20:53.714
<i>Besides, my body has
developed so much...</i>

20:53.829 --> 20:56.912
<i>I! won'! listen lo what I tell it.</i>

20:57.029 --> 20:58.519
...they would like you
to address them...

21:00.509 --> 21:01.556
Were you listening to me?

21:02.229 --> 21:02.798
Huh?

21:04.029 --> 21:07.715
I'm asking about the next battle.
Where is the next battle?

21:32.309 --> 21:33.754
Where are you going?

21:34.189 --> 21:35.031
To the battlefield...

21:39.389 --> 21:43.110
Then please take this.
Your medicine.

21:43.669 --> 21:47.469
These are the ones
Lt. Colonel Mizuki left for you.

21:50.509 --> 21:52.557
There isn't much of this left at all.

21:53.069 --> 21:53.513
<i>So...</i>

21:58.509 --> 21:59.431
What about these??

22:03.909 --> 22:05.070
<i>Li. Colonel Mizuki...</i>

23:00.829 --> 23:02.354
The troops have been ordered to
withdraw from their positions.

23:02.869 --> 23:03.870
Sendai has been destroyed.

23:04.549 --> 23:07.473
Sgt. Major Ito has returned with
a few remaining soldiers.

23:08.229 --> 23:09.355
<i>Have him report to me.</i>

23:10.669 --> 23:11.795
The outpost has been moved...

23:12.149 --> 23:14.436
and the troops will be joining up
with our battalions up north.

23:15.229 --> 23:16.071
Chise's town?

23:16.349 --> 23:16.872
Yes.

23:17.189 --> 23:19.874
Both of you, start preparations
immediately. Move it!

23:30.429 --> 23:32.272
Sgt. Major Ito. <i>..</i>
Where is Chise?

23:32.429 --> 23:33.237
Does she need maintenance?

23:34.309 --> 23:35.993
Chise is ready to fight.

23:37.749 --> 23:39.399
She refuses further maintenance.

23:39.829 --> 23:42.878
She's acting like she's drawn
by the sound of war.

23:44.749 --> 23:46.478
Director, what do we do about Chise?

23:46.909 --> 23:50.516
Shall we keep her on the battlefield
until the troops are fully withdrawn?

23:51.749 --> 23:52.477
Chise is here...!

23:56.269 --> 23:57.475
C-Chise!

24:04.429 --> 24:06.875
Have you all had enough
of playing wan'?

24:07.029 --> 24:07.712
What! ?

24:09.229 --> 24:12.153
Because of your nasty tricks...

24:12.309 --> 24:15.279
so many innocent children
have suffered.

24:17.429 --> 24:19.079
How long must you keep dreaming?

24:19.749 --> 24:23.754
Do you really believe wars
always proceed as planned?

24:25.549 --> 24:29.759
"We will put an end to this war."
Isn't this what you said?

24:30.949 --> 24:34.317
You said you were fighting to save
the people of our country.

24:34.909 --> 24:36.593
Isn't that what you promised?

24:37.829 --> 24:40.560
Yet...nothing has changed.

24:44.989 --> 24:46.912
I am going home.

24:52.509 --> 24:55.718
I made a promise to Lt. Colonel Mizuki...

24:56.309 --> 24:59.074
That in the end I will be
with the one I love.

24:59.909 --> 25:01.559
Your defiance will not be tolerated!

25:02.149 --> 25:04.151
NO! You must not shoot her!

25:04.589 --> 25:06.000
You don't have to shoot.

25:06.149 --> 25:07.753
It's too late.

25:09.709 --> 25:10.949
<i>I'm sow--</i>

25:12.909 --> 25:13.796
l see...

28:23.149 --> 28:24.878
<i>Where am I headed?</i>

28:26.029 --> 28:26.712
<i>Ugh...</i>

28:27.709 --> 28:29.757
I can't hold out much longer.

28:30.589 --> 28:32.353
Where am I going?

28:33.549 --> 28:35.278
Can I do one last thing?

28:36.669 --> 28:37.318
At the end?

28:37.429 --> 28:38.590
<i>You are in love.</i>

28:38.709 --> 28:39.358
What?

28:39.469 --> 28:41.949
<i>That makes you human.</i>

28:43.109 --> 28:46.079
<i>A! the end,
be with the one you love.</i>

28:46.749 --> 28:48.638
The one I love...

28:49.909 --> 28:51.957
Shuji...

28:53.749 --> 28:54.716
Shujil!

28:55.789 --> 28:57.871
Wait for me, Shuji!!

29:02.749 --> 29:05.150
Shuji!! I am back!!

29:10.429 --> 29:13.353
<i>A! the end,
be with the one you love.</i>
